{
  "uid": "netanomaly-visao-geral",
  "title": "netanomaly - visao geral",
  "description": "Painel inicial. Os alertas usam `ts`, que e o tempo do FLUXO -- ao reproduzir pcap historico ajuste o intervalo de tempo do dashboard para a epoca da captura.",
  "tags": [
    "netanomaly",
    "ids"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Acima do corte (24h)",
      "description": "Alertas que passaram de analyst_cut_percentile. O corte e aplicado na consulta, entao mudar o parametro muda este numero retroativamente.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "netanomaly"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "netanomaly"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) AS valor FROM na.v_alertas_correntes\nWHERE ts > now() - interval '24 hours'",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Quase-acertos (7d)",
      "description": "Alertas que o analista confirmou como ataque real mas que ficaram ABAIXO do corte -- o operador nunca os teria visto. E a medida operacional de falso negativo do estagio 1, e o numero que deve estar por tras do botao de retreino.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "netanomaly"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "netanomaly"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) AS valor FROM na.v_stage1_near_misses\nWHERE ts > now() - interval '7 days'",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#eda100",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "#e34948",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Janelas no pool",
      "description": "Janelas elegiveis para treino agora: fora da quarentena e nao despejadas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "netanomaly"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "netanomaly"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) AS valor FROM na.v_training_pool",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
